WEBVTT

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:29.440
I can still see its hanging roof against the cypress trees. Hilltop is no more.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:36.160
There is only a scar of jutting rock where once its windows glittered in the California sun.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.880
My Aunt Amelia's house still stands next door.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.420
I was a welcome guest within its walls, but to me it will always be a house of fear.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:52.780
I was afraid that Sunday morning in September.

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:56.720
I was afraid before the doorbell rang.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.700
Hello, Amelia. Where is he? Where's Kohala?

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:09.420
